{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Photo Cleaner+ 是為 iPhone 儲存空間不足而設的清理工具，適合常拍相片、下載影片或安裝大量 App 的用戶。它透過智能掃描找出重複相片、模糊照片、大型檔案與暫存殘留，讓你快速騰出空間；現時終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $39.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-38.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能掃描整理儲存空間</h2>\n<p>此 App 透過智能掃描整理 iPhone 儲存空間，快速找出重複相片、相似或模糊照片、大型檔案與影片、舊螢幕截圖及暫存殘留，並按可釋放空間排序。你可先預覽每項內容，確認後才一鍵清理，避免誤刪重要回憶；掃描於裝置上進行，刪除前必須由你確認，讓整理儲存空間更安心。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-48-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-49-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-50-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-51-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Photo Cleaner+: Phone Storage 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Photo Cleaner+: Phone Storage</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/phone-storage-space-cleaner/id6757312358\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T19:40:25.471006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":461,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T19:30:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:19:03.393904+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T19:38:29.950390+00:00","content_hash":"d39d481665e999ce30b94b36d2a568d1394079251c4b019cb845aedbbeee6414","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}